        "description": "The ocean is a shared global resource. Ocean-related industries in many countries have expanded with insufficient consideration for the environment, risking natural resources and essential marine ecosystem services that underpin economies and human well-being. </p> <p> The OECD Sustainable Ocean Economy Database synthesises ocean-related datasets, covering 20+ indicators across 6 ocean themes: <li>Natural capital of the ocean</li> <li>Environmental dimension of wellbeing and resilience in coastal communities</li> <li>Environmental and resource productivity of the ocean economy</li> <li>Economi... [1711 chars]",
